.DS_Store
_build/
.mooncakes/
.moonagent/
# The coverage step's tee target (ci.yml) — the one .txt artifact the build
# produces. A global `*.txt` used to sit here and hid every other text file a
# contributor might leave behind, which is not what an ignore list is for.
/coverage-analyze.txt
.claude/
PLAN*.md

# Local project-tour doc (Chinese), kept out of the published package. The
# glob covers the dated snapshot names it gets renamed to when it goes stale —
# nothing here is maintained against the tree, and no doc guard reads it.
项目导览*.md

# Coverage report artifacts (generated by `moon coverage report`)
_coverage/
*.coverage
cobertura.xml
coveralls.json

# Local scratch for reading a `moon coverage analyze` dump (`_cov.txt` is
# its tee target, the local spelling of /coverage-analyze.txt above). The
# helper rode along in a commit once; this keeps the next local `git add`
# from catching it again.
/_cov_extract.py
_cov.txt